<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER SHOWCASE-FEYENOORD AND PSV DRAW 0-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-FEYENOORD AND PSV DRAW 0-0.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feyenoord Rotterdam and PSV Eindhoven drew 0-0 in their Dutch first division match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
